1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:04,960
If the zombie apocalypse starts on a cruise ship, and you're drifting into a storm...

2
00:00:05,300 --> 00:00:08,390
you need the engines back. And they're seven decks down.

3
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:11,300
Rule one. Stay in the crew passages.

4
00:00:12,300 --> 00:00:15,550
The passengers are just on the other side of that wall.

5
00:00:17,700 --> 00:00:20,120
Rule two. Noise travels through metal.

6
00:00:20,500 --> 00:00:23,650
Drop one thing on these stairs, and every deck hears it.

7
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:27,410
So you move slow. Really slow.

8
00:00:28,800 --> 00:00:30,820
Rule three. Light beats speed.

9
00:00:31,400 --> 00:00:34,380
Run in the dark, and you'll miss what's right in front of you.

10
00:00:37,300 --> 00:00:40,020
The engine room. Marco knows the start-up.

11
00:00:40,400 --> 00:00:42,110
Three switches. One lever.

12
00:00:43,500 --> 00:00:45,430
And the engines come back to life.

13
00:00:47,000 --> 00:00:49,080
So does everything else on board.
